<https://w3id.org/bcore> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Core ontology for the representation of bridges."@en .
<https://w3id.org/bcore> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.en" .
<https://w3id.org/bcore> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-07-21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/bcore> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status> "Ontology Specification Draft" .
